    "turn_idx": 13,
    "turn_text": "So, Mr. Vice President, I want to ask, what is your overall assessment of what you've seen? I know we've got the RNC coming up, so the Republicans and certainly the Trump-Pence ticket will get an opportunity to make their case. But what would you want people to take away from what you've seen this week at the DNC?",
