        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience values the opinion of the vice president on political conventions.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "There is meaningful content worth taking away from the DNC experience.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes the DNC has been a significant event worthy of reflection.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
