    "turn_text": "we've got we've got about 300 miles of wall already filled and we've got Mexico doing more to secure our southern border and theirs than ever before. This economy is going to come roaring back under this president. We've already advanced the payroll tax cut for the American people and to build on the historic tax cuts and tax relief this president advanced me think about this for a second and and and all of your listeners should reflect on this in the middle of a global pandemic where over the last three months we actually are seeing the american economy coming back nine million jobs added back to the economy in three months alone joe biden and kamala heris want to raise taxes by $4 trillion. They want to pass a $2 trillion version of the Green New Deal. They want to bury this economy under regulation with the goal of abolishing fossil fuel driving up the cost of energy. President Donald Trump, we're not just going to bring this economy all the way back. We're going to bring it all the way back and then some. The president and I are absolutely convinced as we continue our steady policy of less taxes, less regulation, more American energy and more trade deals that put American jobs and American workers first. We're going to take this economy to all new heights. We'll focus, we're going to continue to, we have a vaccine, we're going to focus on every resource to put this coronavirus in the past, but the American people are opening up again, we're opening up our economy again, we're opening up our schools again, and I think they know come November 3rd that the president who has the vision The policy and the agenda to bring us all the way back and reach all new heights as President Donald Trump.",
